WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.097 --> 00:00:09.930
(heavy breathing)

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:15.333
(dramatic music)

00:00:29.484 --> 00:00:32.317
(heavy breathing)

00:00:43.204 --> 00:00:46.037
(punches, grunts)

00:00:54.486 --> 00:00:56.623
- Why did you bite me?

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:57.772
(growling)

00:00:57.772 --> 00:00:58.886
No, not you.

00:00:58.886 --> 00:00:59.719
You.

00:01:00.721 --> 00:01:02.590
- It was the only way
to get your attention.

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:03.914
I'm Shia Labeouf,

00:01:03.914 --> 00:01:07.199
winner of the 2007 Teen Choice Awards.

00:01:07.199 --> 00:01:08.569
- And who is he?

00:01:08.569 --> 00:01:10.578
- This is the spirit of Harambe.

00:01:10.578 --> 00:01:12.877
One of the great fallen
heroes of our time.

00:01:12.877 --> 00:01:14.920
I'm here to interpret for him.

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.627
- What do you want from me?

00:01:16.627 --> 00:01:18.380
- Harambe is the leader
of an ancient order

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:20.260
of protectors of the earth.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:22.257
He has a very special mission for you.

00:01:22.257 --> 00:01:23.090
- Why me?

00:01:24.103 --> 00:01:25.462
- You need purpose.

00:01:25.462 --> 00:01:28.028
You've run out of ideas for videos.

00:01:28.028 --> 00:01:29.130
- Wait.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:32.297
You're not even Shia Labeouf, are you?

00:01:34.169 --> 00:01:35.911
No I'm not.

00:01:35.911 --> 00:01:37.994
- Stop hurting my friend.

00:01:40.868 --> 00:01:42.535
- What's my mission?

00:01:44.583 --> 00:01:47.333
(dramatic music)

